  She's right. I forgot my purpose here. To wait quietly for the corrective force to ferry us away.

  Normally, amidst a raging inferno would not be the best place to stand idle. Thanks to my armor, however, the flames have little effect.

  I mustn't impact the timeline. And what greater impact than saving a person fated to die?

pt:
//　……そう、そうだった。

//　修正力が働くまで、周囲との干渉を避けて待たなく
